  {
    title: 'A second, genuinely distinct economy: Chikankari embroidery and the handicraft-export trade',
    listItems: [
      "Lucknow is globally known for Chikankari, a fine hand-embroidery craft with a real, sizeable export and domestic-retail economy built around it",
