      "Growing this into a real career or business needs genuine skill-building in design, e-commerce, and export-business practice, not only inherited trade familiarity",
    ],
  },
  {
    title: 'What deliberate planning can add to a craft-economy decision',
    listItems: [
      'Clarity on design, production, quality-control, or export-business roles early prevents drifting inside the trade without a real skill plan',
