      'An honest look at growth ceiling and income potential protects against treating the family trade as a default rather than a considered choice',
      'For those choosing the state-exam-coaching track instead, the same high-value skill portfolio logic applies: proof of work, market positioning, and a deliberate skill choice rather than a default',
    ],
  },
];

const craftEconomySummaryItems = [
  {
