  },
  {
    question: 'My family is in the Chikankari or handicraft-export business. Should counselling assume that is the right path for me?',
    answer:
      "No. Good counselling should treat the handicraft-export path as a real, serious option worth structured planning - including design, production, quality-control, or export-business roles - rather than assuming it is right simply because the family business exists.",
  },
  {
