---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical} jsonLd={jsonLd}>
  <Nav activePage="career-guidance" />

  <section id="hero">
    <div class="hero-bg">
      <div class="orb orb-gold"></div>
      <div class="orb orb-teal"></div>
      <div class="grid"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="container hero-inner">
      <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span>
        <a href="/services">Services</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span>
        <a href="/services/career-counselling-and-career-guidance">Career Counselling and Guidance</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span>
        <a href={BOFU_INTERNAL_LINKS.guidanceLocations}>Locations</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span>
        <span aria-current="page">Career Counselling in Lucknow</span>
      </nav>

      <div class="pill hero-pill">
        <span class="pill-dot"></span>
        Practical support for students, freshers, and working professionals in Lucknow
      </div>

      <h1 class="hero-title">
        Career counselling in Lucknow
        <span class="gold-text"> for practical clarity and stronger next steps</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">
        Lucknow hands many people a genuinely different fork than most Indian cities: one of the country's largest UP-specific UPPSC and state-government-exam coaching economies, running alongside a real, globally known Chikankari embroidery and handicraft-export trade, and a distinct state-secretariat administration job market. Most career advice available online is written for a single generic city and misses all three. If you are at a real decision point, the goal is getting clear before more time goes the wrong way, and building the kind of high-value skill portfolio that unlocks high income opportunities and moves you toward earlier financial freedom.
      </p>
      <p class="hero-note">
        Guidance is delivered fully online in Lucknow and across India. You can start from home, hostel, coaching PG, or workshop - no travel, no waiting for local availability.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="#plans" class="btn-gold pulse">Get Student Career Counselling</a>
        <a href="#plans" class="btn-outline">Get Working Professional Career Counselling</a>
      </div>
      <p class="hero-support">
        The stronger filter is not only whether the search started with Lucknow. It is whether the guidance improves the next move enough to matter.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <BofuListCardSection
    sectionId="local-intent-fit"
    title="Why this decision already feels important"
    subtitle="You want support that feels easier to trust, easier to start, and more useful than generic advice - not another vague conversation."
    items={fitItems}
    variant="contrast"
  >
    <BofuSummaryStrip items={fitSummaryItems} variant="contrast" />
  </BofuListCardSection>

  <ContextualCta
    audience="mixed"
    title="If the Lucknow search already reflects a serious decision, move before more time goes into the wrong direction"
    body="Use this when you want stronger guidance now, not another round of delay while the decision keeps getting more expensive."
    studentHref="#plans"
    studentLabel="Get Student Career Counselling"
    professionalHref="#plans"
    professionalLabel="Get Working Professional Career Counselling"
  />

  <BofuFeatureSection
    sectionId="exam-economy"
    title="The UPPSC and state-exam coaching economy is Lucknow's first real fork"
    subtitle="No other city sibling carries this density of UP-specific state-exam coaching institutes in one place - it deserves a specific answer, not a generic exam-prep mention."
    items={examEconomyItems}
    variant="decision"
  >
    <BofuSummaryStrip items={examEconomySummaryItems} variant="neutral" />
  </BofuFeatureSection>

  <BofuListCardSection
    sectionId="craft-economy"
    title="Chikankari and the handicraft-export trade: a second, genuinely different economy"
    subtitle="A real professional economy under its own pressures, and a genuine choice between it and the state-exam coaching pipeline."
    items={craftEconomyItems}
    columns={2}
    variant="contrast"
  >
    <BofuSummaryStrip items={craftEconomySummaryItems} variant="neutral" />
  </BofuListCardSection>

  <BofuFeatureSection
    sectionId="lucknow-areas"
    title="Lucknow's areas point to different real decisions"
    subtitle="A useful local page should feel grounded in how people actually live and work across Lucknow, not treat it as one flat generic location."
    items={areaItems}
    variant="decision"
  />

  <BofuListCardSection
    sectionId="city-page-vs-broader-guidance"
    title="Choose the stronger starting point for your situation"
    subtitle="For some people, local, Lucknow-specific support is the easiest way to start. For others, broader guidance across paths and skills is the better fit because the decision itself is already the bigger issue."
    items={cityDecisionItems}
    columns={2}
    variant="contrast"
  >
    <BofuSummaryStrip items={cityDecisionSummaryItems} variant="neutral" />
  </BofuListCardSection>

  <GuidanceModelSection
    sectionId="guidance-process"
    title="How practical guidance should move the decision forward"
    subtitle="The point is not a vague conversation. The point is better decisions, higher-value skill direction, proof of work, and a clearer path toward income growth."
  />

  <ComparisonMatrix
    sectionId="comparison"
    title="What makes this more useful than generic counselling"
    subtitle="In a city where a state-exam coaching cycle and a handicraft-export path can each look like the obvious default, the risk is advice that ignores where you actually are. The comparison below shows what separates high-leverage guidance from generic career counselling."
    rows={lucknowComparisonRows}
    centered={true}
  />

  <BofuListCardSection
    sectionId="what-good-support-should-give"
    title="What stronger career counselling should give you"
    subtitle="Good counselling should improve the next decision, not just describe your situation more politely."
    items={deliverableItems}
    columns={3}
    variant="signal"
  >
    <AssessmentSupportNote
      body="As context, if you are still early and not ready for guidance yet, the free assessments can help surface strengths, preferences, and work style before a bigger counselling decision."
      href={BOFU_ASSESSMENT_LINKS.hub}
    />
  </BofuListCardSection>

  <BofuFeatureSection
    sectionId="why-online-still-works"
    title="Why online career counselling can still be the stronger route from Lucknow"
    subtitle="If the city search began as a trust shortcut, the next question is whether online guidance gives you a clearer, more practical next move than defaulting to whoever simply happens to be nearby."
    items={onlineAdvantageItems}
    variant="decision"
  />

  <BofuFeatureSection
    sectionId="common-doubts"
    title="Common doubts before starting"
    subtitle="These are the doubts worth resolving before you pay for any counselling support."
    items={objectionItems}
    variant="signal"
  />

  <BofuFeatureSection
    sectionId="what-to-keep-ready"
    title="What to keep ready before you pay for any career counselling"
    subtitle="A stronger conversation starts faster when the real pressure, the real options, and the real constraints are already visible."
    items={prepItems}
    variant="signal"
  />

  <BuyerChecks
    title="What to check before paying any career counselling service"
    subtitle="Do not compare only convenience or the city label. Compare whether the process improves decision quality, skill direction, and the practical next step."
    items={buyerCheckItems}
  />

  <ContextualCta
    audience="mixed"
    title="Locality can matter, but decision quality should still be what settles it"
    body="The practical value is clearer fit, trade-offs, and next steps before a wrong route hardens further."
    studentHref="#plans"
    studentLabel="Get Student Career Counselling"
    professionalHref="#plans"
    professionalLabel="Get Working Professional Career Counselling"
  />

  <GuidancePlansSection
    audience="mixed"
    serviceLabel="Career Counselling"
  />

  <LinkDirectorySection
    sectionId="related-help"
    title="Explore related help"
    subtitle="See the main guidance pages, free assessments, and other useful resources before you decide."
    items={relatedItems}
    altBackground={true}
  />

  <BofuFaqSection
    sectionId="faq"
    title="Questions people ask before choosing career counselling in Lucknow"
    items={faqItems}
  />

